  "sections": [
    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Rig Relay Update Policy",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Principles",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. **Notification-first**: Update checks are informational. The user or parent orchestrator decides when to act. 2. **No restart during active sessions**: Sessions MUST NOT be interrupted. Restart is deferred to idle/session boundaries. 3. **Install-channel-aware**: The recommended update command depends on how Rig Relay was installed. 4. **User-controlled**: Automatic restart is opt-in only (`auto_restart_at_idle`). 5. **Structured events**: Agents receive `update_status` via current_state, not random terminal spam.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Update State Machine",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-5",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "up_to_date → update_available → update_downloaded → restart_pending\n                                                      ↓\n                    restart_blocked_active_sessions ← restart_pending\n                                                      ↓\n                                              restart_ready\n                                                      ↓\n                                            restart_completed",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-6",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "State",
        "Meaning"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`up_to_date`",
          "Current version matches latest known"
        ],
        [
          "`update_available`",
          "New version detected, not yet downloaded"
        ],
        [
          "`update_downloaded`",
          "Package downloaded, awaiting restart"
        ],
        [
          "`restart_pending`",
          "Restart queued"
        ],
        [
          "`restart_blocked_active_sessions`",
          "Restart deferred because sessions > 0"
        ],
        [
          "`restart_ready`",
          "No active sessions, restart can proceed"
        ],
        [
          "`restart_completed`",
          "Restart finished successfully"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Recommended Update Commands",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-8",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Install Source",
        "Update Command"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`uv_tool`",
          "`uv tool upgrade rig-relay`"
        ],
        [
          "`pipx`",
          "`pipx upgrade rig-relay`"
        ],
        [
          "`pip`",
          "`pip install --upgrade rig-relay`"
        ],
        [
          "`homebrew`",
          "`brew upgrade rig-relay`"
        ],
        [
          "`npm`",
          "`npm update -g rig-relay`"
        ],
        [
          "`source`",
          "`git pull && uv sync`"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Safe Restart Flow",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. Update check detects new version. 2. Emit `rig.relay.update.available` event. 3. Parent/reviewer sees `update_status` in `current_state`. 4. If `active_sessions > 0`, mark `restart_blocked_active_sessions`. 5. When all child sessions finish: - Checkpoint if allowed. - Export pending artifacts. - Prompt user or orchestrator. 6. If `auto_restart_at_idle` is enabled, restart automatically. 7. After restart, emit `restart_completed`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Agent Visibility",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Agents see updates via `current_state`:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-13",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "json",
      "content": "{\n  \"update_status\": {\n    \"current_version\": \"0.1.0a1\",\n    \"latest_version\": \"0.1.0a2\",\n    \"update_available\": true,\n    \"install_source\": \"uv_tool\",\n    \"recommended_update_command\": \"uv tool upgrade rig-relay\",\n    \"restart_required\": false,\n    \"restart_safe\": false,\n    \"blocked_by_active_sessions\": 2,\n    \"update_state\": \"restart_blocked_active_sessions\",\n    \"checked_at\": \"...\"\n  }\n}",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "CLI Update Check",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-15",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "bash",
      "content": "rig-relay update check           # Check for update, print status\nrig-relay update status          # Show current update state",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "These commands do not modify the system. They only check and report.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
